śrī gurave śivāye namaḥ |

oṃ namaḥ paramātmane ||

oṃ namo gaṇādhipataye namaḥ ||

oṃ namo viṣṇave ||


<p. 55a> oṃ namaḥ śivāya sa śivāya śivadāya namo namaḥ |


[atha candrajñānaṃ likhyate] ||


oṃ kailāsapiṭhamadhyasthaṃ devadevaṃ maheśvaram |
skandanandigaṇākīrṇaṃ viśveśvarasamanvitam || 1 ||

brahmādi kāraṇaiḥ sārdhamumayā sahitaṃ sthitam |
mahodarasamāyuktamapsarobhiḥ samāvṛtam || 2 ||

mahādhyānasthitaṃ devaṃ munibhiścāpi saṃvṛtam |
gandharvādi gaṇopetaṃ siddhasaṅghaiśca saṃyutam || 3 ||

srūyamānaṃ suravaraiḥ sādhyarudramarudghanaiḥ |
nārada pramukhaiścaiva gītanṛttaviśāradaiḥ || 4 ||

ārādhyamānaṃ deveśaṃ varadaṃ lokakāraṇam |
sarvānugrahakartāraṃ sarvapāpapraṇāśanam || 5 ||

<p. 55b> sarvamantravaraṃ nāthaṃ sarvadeva namaskṛtam |
tatrasthaṃ devadeveśamumayāsahitaṃ śivam || 6 ||

dṛṣṭvā tu varadaṃ devaṃ dhyānasthaṃ taṃ kapālinam |
saṃśayā viṣṭacittastu candro vedavidāṃpatiḥ || 7 ||

aṣṭāṅgapraṇipātena praṇamya parameśvaram |
rodamāno bravīdvākyamucchasaṃśca punaḥ punaḥ || || 9 ||

indrajālaṃ hi paśyāmi asatyaṃ satyatāṃ gatam |
mohitaṃ māyayā sarvaṃ brahāṇḍaṃ sa carācaram || 9 ||

devamānuṣya tiryañca gandharvoragarākṣasām |
sarveṣāṃ niścitā buddhiḥ praṇaṣṭā iti me matiḥ || 10 ||

kṣaṇikasya tu rūpasya tathā śabdasya vai prabho |
tvayoktasyaiva candrasya buddhi rūpasya nityaśaḥ || 11 ||

<p. 56a> ākāśasya kathaṃ deva praṇamanti vināśinaḥ |
svayamevamasaunaṣṭaścintayāyaḥ prakalpitaḥ || 12 ||

śabdasya kṛtakaṃ caiva mantratvaṃ ca kathaṃ bhavet |
prayuktā ca yathā vīṇā tantrīsvara samanvitā || 13 ||

cittena sāryate yasya ṣaḍjamadhyamadaivatā |
tathā mantrā tadākārā vidyāścaiva sahasraśaḥ || 14 ||

aprabuddhadhiyomūḍhāḥ svacittaṃ te bahiḥ sthitāḥ |
kṛtake naiva santuṣṭā bhrāmitā māyayā punaḥ || 15 ||

asatyamindrajālasya yadrūpaṃ tatkathaṃ prabho |
uccāryamāṇā ye mantrā na te samyak tvayoditāḥ || 16 ||

mohitā devagandharvā mithyājñānena garvitāḥ |
<p. 56b> māyāsvapnopamāḥ sarve mudrādhyanādi dhāraṇāḥ || 17 ||

na taccitramivāsatyaṃ śāstrajālaṃ kriyāgamam |
devyā vināyakasyaiva ṣaṇmukhasya trilocanam || 18 ||

nandibhṛṅgi mahākāla kaubīrośanasāṃ tathā |
vāsukirgāruḍaścaiva brahmaṇo viṣṇurudrayoḥ || 19 || 

sanatkuārapramukhādṛṣīṇāṃ bhāvitātmanām |
durvāsapramukhādīnāṃ munīnāṃ yastu saṃhitaḥ || 20 ||

mantrāśca vividhākārā devyāścāpi sahasraśaḥ |
saṃprāptāvividhākārā vidyāścāpi sahasraśaḥ || 21 ||

kathitāśca yathāpūrvaṃ yukti yuktāḥ samāsataḥ |
tatsantuṣṭa mahādeva śirassthena mayā śrutam || 22 ||




(????????????????????)

<p. 57a> bhrāmitāste mayā sarve vyāyāmena maheśvarāḥ |
na jñātaṃ kasyacijjñānaṃ śārīraṃ gūḍhagocaram || 13 ||

aprabuddhamatitvāśca śāstrajāle bhramanti te |
kṛtakaṃ naiva santuṣṭāḥ svacittamuṣitāḥ sthitāḥ || 14 ||

mayāśrūtāgamapathātantre tantre tvayā kṛtāḥ |
sambhāvaṃ kasyacennoktaṃ mohitāḥ paramārthikāḥ || 15 ||

ko mantraḥ kṛtako nāma kasya karmamatistathā |
dīyate kasya vā piṇḍaṃ vāyurvāyau pralīyate || 16 ||

āpastvapsvapralīyante viśet tejaśca tejasi |
ākāśe tu tathākāśaṃ manobuddhirahaṃ tathā || 17 ||

yathā gatāḥ punastatra līnāḥ sve sve pade tu te |
ko yaṃ māṃsa mayo deho dagdho vā prāṇibhakṣitaḥ || 18 ||

<p. 57b> amūrto nirguṇo jīvo hyanādiścāpyakhaṇḍitaḥ |
na rūpaṃ tasya no varṇo na sthānaṃ na ca dhāraṇā || 19 ||

kasya kālo yaśaḥ kasya bhaṭāścaiva sudāruṇāḥ |
narakāśśāsanāścaiva pretapuṇyaṃ vasetakaḥ || 20 ||

sahasrasaṅkhyāḥ puruṣā āhave ye hatāstute |
nīyante bahubhiḥkālaireko vā kiṃ bahūnnayet || 21 ||

pakṣiṇo vihvalī bhūtā nirgatena layaṃ gatāḥ |
lakṣasaṅkhyāśca vahavastatra kālaḥkimāgataḥ || 22 ||

eke naiva hi kālena sahasrāṇyarbudhāni ca |
nīyante bahubhiḥ kiṃ vā etatsarvaṃ vadasva me || 23 ||

śṛṇu candra pravakṣyāmi rahasyaṃ bhuvidurlabham |
yanna kasya cidākhyātaṃ nissaṃśaya karaṃparam || 24 ||

<p. 58a> na mantro varṇasaṃyogādya upādyaḥ kriyāparaḥ |
tāneśa parameśāna mohanyuktā tu mātṛkā || 25 ||

paśūnāṃ sthūlamārgena svātmavijñānavartmani |
saṃbhavanti yathovarṇāḥ svaravyañjanasaṃjñakāḥ || 26 ||

akṣarakṣarayoryattadakṣaraṃ cākṣarādhikam |
tasyādhikāraṇaṃ yat tad vāgbhirvaktuṃ na śakyate || 27 ||

tadakṣaraṃ na jānanti mithyā garveṇa mohitāḥ |
tajjñātvā bījarājaṃ tu varuṇānalamadhyagam || 28 ||

na jāyeta punargarbhe yadyapi brahmahā bhavet |
parivārāṅga vistāraṃ nāmajāti vivarjitam || 29 ||

ekavīraṃ smṛtaṃ mantraṃ saṅkṣiptaṃ vidhi sādhanam |
śabdāvasthaṃ parityajya bodharūpeṇasaṃsthitam || 30 ||

<p. 58b> svaramādya svaraṃ jñeyaṃ taṃ svaraṃ svaravarjitam |
asvaraṃ paramaṃ mantraṃ yogināṃ mokṣadaṃ dhruvam || 31 ||

tuṭirṇavanimeṣāśca tathā kāṣṭhāḥ kalāstathā |
śaśadhavaravidyāṃ ca muhūrtadinarātribhiḥ || 32 ||

pakṣamāsaṃ tvayanayoryaṃ vatsara tamaḥ smṛtaḥ |
kīlanāddvijarājaivamevaṃ kālobhidhīyate || 33 ||

kṛtasya karmaṇaścaiva līnaḥ kālassatena vai |
nīyate dehasaṃsthena karmaṇākālarūpiṇā || 34 ||

nākṛtirvikṛtirnāsti kālasya paramārthataḥ |
sukhaduḥkha phalaṃ bhuṅkte jīvaḥ svasyaivakarmaṇaḥ || 35 ||

ekaḥ kṛtāntaḥ saṃhārī paśu hṛdbhavati kṣaṇāt |
āyuḥ kṣīṇāśca ye bhūtāstiryañcomānuṣāḥ surāḥ || 36 ||

<p. 59a> teṣāṃ niyamanārthāya kālonāmapravartate |
na dveṣānna ca vairāgyāṅkālaḥ karmedamucyate || 37 ||

kālena nīyate ko sau kiṃ rūpaṃ tasya śaṅkara |
kiṃ vidhau devadeveśa jīvonāmamaheśvara || 38 ||

kasmin sthāne vasejjīvo mriyate sa kutaḥ punaḥ |
kathaṃ kālaḥ praśamati jīva sthāne trilocana || 39 ||

etatsarvaṃ samāsena sadbhāvena vada prabho |
śṛṇu tāvat pravakṣyāmi rahasyaṃ bhuvi durlabham || 40 ||

jīvo hyanādiramalo niṣkalo virajaḥ katham |
śaktigarbha sthito nityaṃ rūpaṃ dhyānavivarjitam || 41 ||

pramāṇatarkarahitastva hetuśca nirañjanaḥ |
<p. 59b> upamānavaśaścandra śṛṇu pātrastu kalpitaḥ || 42 ||

bālāgraśatabhāgastu vaidikorupagīyate |
trividhaḥ sa tu vijñeyaḥ śāktogrā kārakaḥ smṛtaḥ || 43 ||

śāntaḥ śūnyo nirābhāsastvaprameyo nirañjanaḥ |
sarvopamānarahitaḥ kalpanā kālavarjitaḥ || 44 ||

dvitīyaṃ yasya yadrūpaṃ śaktiḥ saivopagīyate |
guṇātmikā tu vijñeyā prakṛtistattva rūpiṇī || 45 ||

mahābhūtāḥ smṛtāḥ pañca manobuddhirahaṅkṛtā |
eṣā prakṛtirutpanā saṃsthitā sarva dehiṣu || 46 ||

tasyāḥ kriyā kramaṃ sarvaṃ piṇḍadānādi lakṣaṇam |
etacchrutvā dhva(?)hāsena candro vedavidāṃbaraḥ || 47 ||

vihasya suciraṃ kālaṃ dvijarājobhavra(?)vedidam |
<p. 60a> pañcabhūtātmakaṃ piṇḍaṃ pañcasthāna gataṃ prabho || 48 ||

svasthāne ca manobuddhirahaṃkāraḥ pralīyate |
ye ye bhāvā yathā yātāstathā tatra layaṃ gatāḥ || 49 ||

sarvajñasaṃśayasyāsya kiṃ bravihi vinirṇayam || 50 ||

śṛṇu sadbhāva kathanaṃ rahasya mamṛtodbhavam |
mūrtairbrahmādibhiścaiva vedarājayamena ca || 51 ||

varuṇena tathā candra agnivittapavāyunā |
ātmārthaṃ racitaṃ śāstraṃ kriyākāṇḍamanuttamam || 52 ||

piṇḍaṃ ca māsikaśrāddhaṃ tathā sāṃvatśarīyakam |
prajārthaṃ sarvabhūtānāṃ jīvanopāya hetukam || 53 ||

kṛtaṃ śāstraṃ prajārthānnaṃ pradadanti parasparam |
<p. 60b> annena jīvalokoyaṃ vartate sarvasambhavaḥ || 54 ||

sadbhāvena tu jīvasya arūpasyāvyayasya ca |
śrāddhadānādikaṃ karma na ca piṇḍodaka kriyā || 55 ||

sarvopamānahīnasya kalpanā rahitasya ca |
kutaḥ piṇḍaṃ kutaḥ śrāddhaṃ kutodāhādi lakṣaṇam || 56 ||

brahmādyairacitaṃ śrāddhaṃ mohanārthaṃ dvijottama |
sthiti kāraṇahetuṃ tvādbhūtā (* * *?) ta saṃskṛtam || 57 ||

karmanāma dvijendrendra asti sarveṣu vastuṣu |
svakarmaṇā sukhaṃ bhuṅkte duḥkhaṃ bhuṅkte svakarmaṇā || 58 ||


yathā ca kurute karma tathaiva bhuñjate punaḥ |
yena yena svabhāvena prakṛtisthāṃ tyajet tanum || 59 ||

tena te naiva mārgeṇa sva sva karmopabhuñjate |
<p. 61a> jīvaḥ saṃsarate dehānna cāsau mriyate punaḥ || 60 ||

janmārthe tyajate kāyaṃ kriyārthaṃ kāyameva ca |
na naṣṭaścaiva notpanno baddho mukto na cāpyasau || 61 ||

śakterabhyantarasthāyī yathāsau jāyate punaḥ |
na kṛtirguṇapāśaistu veṣṭitāssarvadehinām || 62 ||

tasyāḥ karma yathāsaṃsthaṃ cchāyā vadanu tiṣṭhati |
yena bhāvena yo tyantaḥ prakṛtergacchate punaḥ || 63 ||

tena vai prakṛtaṃ karma tatra tatra pravartate |
jīvo dvandva vinirmuktaḥ sarvakarmasusaṃsthitaḥ || 64 ||

na tena rahitaṃ kiñcidvidyate bhuvana traye |
yathā vṛtau gatau vāyuḥ saṃsthitasya dvijeśvara || 65 ||

tathā sarveṣu bhūteṣu śaktirvai prāṇarūpiṇī |
<p. 61b> tatrasthaṃ yatparaṃ śūnyaṃ candrajīvaṃ tu taṃ viduḥ || 66 ||

vinaṣṭakālayogena dhṛtiścaiva dvijādhipa |
yat tat tattvadharaṃ śūnyaṃ sa kathaṃ caiva naśyati || 67 ||

yathā nabhassthito vāyurghaṭā madhye virājate |
sahasā ca ghaṭe bhinne na vāyurvidyate kvacit || 68 ||

evaṃ sarvaśarīrastho dehapātānna pacyati |
darpaṇānanasaṃyoga jalārka pratibimbite || 69 ||

bhraṣṭe ca darpaṇe candra na naṣṭaṃ caiva mānanam |
jalakṣayādyathā cārko naiva naśyati vai kvacit || 70 ||

evaṃ dehakṣayād dehī na naṣṭo na ca badhyate |
sarvagaḥ sarvakartā ca sarvadvandva bahiṣkṛtaḥ || 71 ||

na tasya kālakalanā na rāgadveṣa eva ca |
puṣpairgandhai tilaistailaṃ kṣīre sarpistato nalaḥ || 72 ||

<p. 62a> indhane ca yathā saṃsthastathāsau sarvagaḥ paraḥ |
śakterabhyantare jīvaḥ saṃsthito naiva lipyate || 73 ||

yathā veśmāntara gataṃ nabhaḥ sarvagataṃ sthitam |
catuṣkena pranaṣṭe tu tannabho naiva naśyati || 74 ||

evaṃ sarvaśarīrasthaḥ śūnyarūpo hyalepakaḥ |
na tasya kālo mṛtyurvā na piṇḍaḥ śrāddhalakṣaṇam || 75 ||

etatsadbhāvakathanaṃ mayā tedyaprakāśitam |
etacchrutvādyavai candraḥ praphultakamalekṣaṇaḥ || 76 ||

apūrvamadbhutaṃ deva śrūtaṃ tvatto mayādyavai |
prakṛtiḥ kiṃ vidhā caiva rūpaṃ tasyāstu kīdṛśam |
mānaṃ tu karaṇaṃ tasya pramāṇaṃ vada bhairava || 78 ||

<p. 62b> anacchā aśirekaurādvikubjā tantu rūpiṇī |
prāṇāpānapravāhena gacchate viśate punaḥ || 79 ||

sarpavatkuṭilākārā bālāgraparimāṇagā |
guṇāḥ sarve sthitāstasyā uparāgāmaṇeriva || 80 ||

maṇi rūpāparāśaktiruparāgopamā guṇā |
tena tena svabhāvena tatra tatrāvatiṣṭhate || 81 ||

caturdaśa vidhe sarge śaktirnāma parā kalā |
darpaṇe ca yathā cchāyā jalamadhye tu tārakāḥ || 82 ||

guṇāḥ prakṛtijāstadvaddṛśyante śakti madhyagāḥ |
karmaṇā svena bhāvena taṃ tu bhuñjanti dehinaḥ || 83 ||

śaktigarbha sthito jīvo vaṃśe dhvanirivasthitaḥ |
evaṃ śaktikanirjīvaḥ sukhadohlādakaḥ smṛtaḥ || 84 ||

<p. 63a> āpādāścaiva mūrdhāntaṃ sarvatraiva vyavasthitaḥ |
kālāgnyādi śivāntaṃ ca yadrūpaṃ kiñcid dṛśyate || 85 ||

tatra cābhyantare śūnyaṃ saṃsthitaṃ caiva sa prabhuḥ |
aśmāntaragataścaiva asthirandhraśca saṃsthitaḥ || 86 ||

na tena rahitaḥ prāṇaḥ prakaroti gamāgamam |
rahasyaṃ tedya vakṣyāmi ekāgraḥ śṛṇu tatparaḥ || 87 ||

ata ūrddhaṃ diśaḥ sarvā bhūmirāpo nalastathā |
vāyuścakhaṃmanobuddhirahaṅkāraśca ye guṇāḥ || 88 ||

sarvaśūnyaṃ nirālambaṃ tatra sarve pratiṣṭhitāḥ |
yat kiñcit sakalaṃ bhāvaṃ rūpataḥ keṣusaṃsthitam || 89 ||

tadasārataraṃ candrarūpaṃ svapnopamaṃ sthitam |
bhrāntiṃ tyaja sa vai putra sarvaṃ śūnye pratiṣṭhitam || 90 ||

<p. 63b> śūnyāt pravartate śaktiḥ śaktervarṇāḥ prajajñire |
varṇebhyaśca tathā mantrā mantrebhyaḥ sṛṣṭiravyayā || 91 ||

tasmācchūnyaṃ jagaddhyāyedyannanaśyet kadācana |
yugādinā tato adya nityaṃ sada sataḥ param || 92 ||

hṛdistho lakṣyate naiva sarvadarśī hyalepakaḥ |
nāyaṃ piṇḍesti na śrāddhaṃ na kālakalanā tathā || 93 ||

sarvakriyā vihīnosau saṃsthito naiva lipyate |
bhūtagrāmeṣu sarveṣu śaktyantarvasate prabhuḥ || 94 ||

sa bāhyābhyantaraṃ caiva sarvaṃ tena pratitiṣṭhitam |
sthitaṃ tadeva bhāṇḍāsthaṃ sarvasya varavarṇakam || 95 ||

kriyābhedaguṇānāṃ ca bhedo mantreṣu vidyate |
jñānabhedo na vidyeta teṣāṃ śāstrāgameṣu ca || 96 ||

<p. 64a> adyāpi na mayājñātamindrajālasya lakṣaṇam |
prakṛtirnāmadeveśa ādhāradharaṇī yathā || 97 ||

tataḥ śāstre tvayā pūrvaṃ jīvaṃ caiva sugūhitam |
na naṣṭā na ca saṃbhrāntiradyāpi parameśvara || 98 ||

sadbhāvaṃ vadadeveśa yathā jānāmyahaṃ punaḥ || ||

yathā nabhaścyutāścandra tuṣārāssa tatopamāḥ |
saro madhye ca patitā galitā ekatāṃ gatāḥ || 100 ||

tathā guṇāmarasthā tu śaktistaddharmadhāriṇī |
nirguṇatvaṃ guṇaṃ yasya arūpaṃ caiva rūpakam || 101 ||

tathā vidhaṃ tu yat kiñcicchakti garbhe vyavasthitam |
tena sarvamidaṃ vyāptamābrahmabhuvanāntikam || 102 ||

<p. 64b> tataḥ kriyāḥ pravartante hetu proktamidaṃ jagat |
āṇavaṃ ca tathā śāktaṃ bindunādātmakaṃ ca yat || 103 ||

vāyūnāṃ ca gamaṃ kiñcit prāṇāpānakṣaṇātmikam |
sarvaśivamayaṃ candra śivo jīvaḥ prakīrtitaḥ || 104 ||

śāstrajālaṃ parityajya tarkajālamathottaram |
adhyātmajñānasambodhaṃ śaktigarbhaṃ tu yo bhyaset || 105 ||

naiva naśyatyasau candra na kālaścāsya vidyate |
ajarāmarabhūto vai bhavate nātrasaṃśayaḥ || 106 ||

jīvo na jāto na mṛtaḥ parāparagamaḥ sthitaḥ |
karmaṇāṃ caiva mahato guṇānāṃ bhūtajastathā || 107 ||

prakṛtistu parāśaktiryatraiva bhrānti lakṣaṇam |
idaṃ rahasyaṃ paramaṃ kathayāmi tavākhilam || 108 ||

avijñāte pare tattve na tyajet tu kriyā kramam |
<p. 65a> paśutvaṃ ca patitvaṃ ca dvau bhedau ca śarīriṇām || 109 ||

paśutvāt karmajālena gṛhyate hyamṛtodbhavam |
yathābhrairarkaraśmibhyo darpaṇaṃ ca malena ca || 110 ||

sphaṭikaṃ pāṃsunā yad vat tathā jñānaṃ tamo vṛtam |
ajñānāddṛśyate janturguṇapāśaistu yantritaḥ || 111 ||

karmopabhogaṃ bhuñjīta tiṣṭhate svānna yoniṣu |
na deho mriyate bhuṅkte karmabhogeti tasya vai || 112 ||

patijñānaṃ prabuddhastu sarvajñaḥ parameśvaraḥ |
prāpnoti jñānamabhyāsājjñānānmuktastu mocakaḥ || 113 ||

caṇḍālo hīnajanmā ca śvapaco vāpi phukkasaḥ |
sarvagaṃ paramaṃ devaṃ hetūpādhivivarjitam || 114 ||

samyag jānāti yaścandra sa yogī cottamomataḥ |
<p. 65b> vipro vā mūḍhabuddhiśca ajñāna spṛśya eva saḥ || 115 ||

caṇḍālo yadi vā jñānī tasmai deyaṃ pratigraham |
tasya hastā tu vai grāhya sa ca pūjyo yathā hyaham || 116 ||

bhrāntiṃ tyajasva vai candra hyetajjñānaṃ samabhya sa |
ajñānācca kriyākāṇḍaṃ jñānāt karmakṣayo bhavet || 117 ||

niyamo na ca vā kālo bhrāntimetāṃ parityaja |
ajñānāt karmapāśaistu prakṛtairbadhyate punaḥ || 118 ||

prabuddhānāṃ sadā candra sarvajñānamayaṃ jagat |
sarvaṃ jagat svadehaṃ vā parānandena pūritam || 119 ||

sarvaśaṅkāḥ parityajya śūnyabhūmiṃ bhavet tu saḥ |
na kālo na yamaḥ kaścidetā bāla vibhīṣakāḥ || 120 ||

sarvopamā na hīnasya kalpanā rahitasya ca |
<p. 66a> kutaḥ kālaḥ kuto mṛtyurnarake śāsanāḥ katham || 121 ||

sarvaṃ śūnyamayaṃ dhyāyeccharīrā vayavaṃ ca yat |
kāyaṃ śūnyamayaṃ kṛtvā na kiñcidapi carcayet || 122 ||

vikalpa yoniṃ majjanti jantavaḥ prakṛtestute |
guṇapāśairnibadhyante mūḍhāḥ pāparatāḥ punaḥ || 123 ||

yatra yatra hi yonyantarjāyante te svakarmaṇā |
tatra tatrājñā bhāvatvaṃ paśūnāṃ syāt sadodūpa || 124 ||

karmāṇi kasya vai deva hyetan me vada tattvataḥ |
yadi jīvo hi muktaśca nīrūpaḥ khasvarūpakaḥ || 125 ||

nīrūpasya kathaṃ karma śūnyabhūtasya vai prabho |
etadicchāmyahaṃ śrotuṃ tvat pramādāt kapāla bhṛt || 126 ||

<p. 66b> śūnyasya dviguṇasyaiva karma tasya karoti kim |
prakṛtirguṇasaṃpūrṇā mriyate jāyate tathā || 127 ||

kṛta karma tathātmīyaṃ yathāsau bhuñjate punaḥ |
na jīvo bhuñjate karma na cāsau prakṛtirguṇaiḥ || 128 ||

badhyate na ca vā mukto nāsthāyī sthāna varjitaḥ |
sarvajñaḥ sarvagodhyakṣaḥ kharūpī khamanaḥ khagaḥ  || 129 ||

iti me yogino dṛṣṭābrahmaviṣṇvendra bhārgavāḥ |
te pi pra(?)mohamāpannā jīvaṃ jñānavidhau sadā || 130 ||

satyaṃ ca kathayiṣyāmi dvijarājādyame śṛṇu |
pravṛtyarthaṃ tu bhūtānāṃ prakṛtārthamasaṃsthitaḥ || 131 ||

tathābaddhaṃ jagatsarvaṃ mūtremaṇigaṇā iva |
<p. 67a> ādhāradharaṇī śaktiraśirāhaṃ sa rūpiṇī || 132 ||

tanmadhye saṃsthito jīvaḥ kharūpī vyāpakaḥ prabhuḥ |
yathā veśmāntara gataṃ nabhaḥ sarvagataṃ sthitam || 133 ||

veśmapātena naṣṭosau jīvaścādhāra pātane |
tad vat sarvagataṃ brahma sarvatraiva susaṃsthitam || 134 ||

tārakendra tyajabhrāntiṃ kimanyat kathayāmite || 35 ||

atyantagahanaṃ deva rahasyaṃ bhuvidurlabham |
tvat prasādānmayājñātaṃ jīvalakṣaṇamuttamam || 36 ||

adyame saphalaṃ janma adya me saphalaṃ tapaḥ |
adya jātosmyahaṃ deva jñānenānena bhairava || 37 ||

mahatāstotrarājena devadevo maheśvaraḥ |
toṣito vai mahādevaścandreṇa ca yathā kṛtaḥ || 38 ||

<p. 67b> parituṣṭena devena varaṃ dattvā yathāvidhi |
jñānabhogī ca madvākyāt pūrvoktamyā mṛtodbhava || 39 ||

mahābhāgi bhaviṣyaiṣā metanmedattavāndharam |
evamuktvā yadā devo virarāma maheśvaraḥ || 40 ||

candraśca prāptavānjñānaṃ candrajñānamataḥ smṛtam |
bhaktāyedaṃ pradātavyaṃ śraddhādānāya dhīmate || 41 ||

yonindayati mohena idaṃ śāstramagauravam |
sa mūḍhaḥ sarvadā tiṣṭedātmajñānenasaṃyutaḥ || 42 ||


